I'd really like to play this game -- but I can't. Don't buy this if you use multiple screens. (In my case: 1x UHD + 1x FHD)
Starting the game works fine for the first few seconds -- it shows a logo on the primary screen. After that, it knows everything better than the user; starts changing the resolution of both screens, switching monitors off and on, blacking out one ot both screens without shutting them off, and moving other applications' windows by doing so. After about 2-3 minutes I can see a main menu, but the Abzu window has lost its focus. As soon as I click it, the whole screen flickering starts again, resulting in the same situation as before.
@Devs: Please take my screen resolution, and leave it alone. If the game can't render in that resolution, create a window with a suitable resolution.

